Today is Sunday morning.
I am in my room.
My new shirt is on the bed.
It is very small for me.
I need a bigger shirt than this.
Yesterday afternoon was very humid.
Therefore, I did not go back to the market yesterday.
Today morning's weather is a little better.
I pick up my shopping bag.
I look inside the bag.
The paper receipt is in the bag.
The receipt is necessary to exchange the shirt.
I put the receipt and the shirt back in the bag.
I come out of my flat.
I walk to the bus stop.
The bus arrives in a short while.
I board the bus and get my ticket.
There is not much crowd on the road on Sundays.
I get off the bus and go straight to the garment shop.
